    <detaileddescription>
<para>A function with <computeroutput>n_components</computeroutput>, but whose goal is only to be called for the component <computeroutput>field_component</computeroutput>, for which it returns the value return by the given callback <computeroutput>field_fun</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>It returns 0 for all other vector components. </para>
